# Rotate page turns the comic sideways. The controls have to fit the turned
# panel, Reading options included, so the page can be turned back.
wait-for Try a sample comic
tap Try a sample comic
wait-for CBZ
tap-at 536,1378
wait-for Available on this reader
tap Open
wait-for-id comic-next
wait-idle
tap-at 536,724
wait-for Fit page
tap Reading options
wait-for Rotate page
tap Rotate page
wait-idle
clean
shot rotated-page
tap-id comic-controls
wait-for Fit page
expect Reading options
expect Move page
clean
shot rotated-controls
tap Reading options
wait-for Rotate page
tap Rotate page
wait-idle
